      "description": "One or more Dailymotion channels to fetch uploads from (mode=byUser). Accepts usernames (`euronews-en`), profile URLs (`https://www.dailymotion.com/user/euronews-en`), or profile IDs. Existing tasks with the old `username` field keep working.",
      "editor": "stringList",
